<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN CUP RESULTS. [CORRECTED 4:43 GMT 14/11]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN CUP RESULTS. [CORRECTED 4:43 GMT 14/11]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of German Cup matches played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Energie Cottbus 0 St Pauli	0 - after extra time</p>
<p>(Cottbus won 5-4 on penalties)</p>
<p> Bayern Munich   3 Werder Bremen 1</p>
<p>(Corrects to show matches were not quarter finals)</p>
